  "description": "Connect Claude Code to SupaLens to instantly generate analytics dashboards from your codebase. Claude reads your models and schema, infers business KPIs, generates SQL, and registers live widgets to your SupaLens dashboard — no setup, no manual queries. Supports any Postgres-backed project.",
